    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">STEP INTO THE MANSION</h2>Step into a run-down old mansion and start to learn what secrets this place is hiding as you explore deeper and deeper. Collect map fragments and carefully plan your route as you try to avoid the monsters that roam the halls.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003470/extras/49fc9016b8838802e8f866319bcfa2f8.poster.avif?t=1674650032\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003470/extras/49fc9016b8838802e8f866319bcfa2f8.webm?t=1674650032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003470/extras/49fc9016b8838802e8f866319bcfa2f8.mp4?t=1674650032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FIGHT</h2>Strategically manage your inventory and items. Expend ammo fighting enemies or preserve it for future encounters but be warned, these enemies are smarter than they seem and will adapt to fighting you.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003470/extras/70e93bad221e69bdee4d0a841a920f56.poster.avif?t=1674650032\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003470/extras/70e93bad221e69bdee4d0a841a920f56.webm?t=1674650032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003470/extras/70e93bad221e69bdee4d0a841a920f56.mp4?t=1674650032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SURVIVAL</h2>You will need to scavenge for all the supplies you can get if you plan on surviving through this mansion until the end, searching every nook and cranny and carefully observing the environment might help you find clues and solve puzzles.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003470/extras/046109983b6f3700738fd02ef36e0eec.poster.avif?t=1674650032\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003470/extras/046109983b6f3700738fd02ef36e0eec.webm?t=1674650032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003470/extras/046109983b6f3700738fd02ef36e0eec.mp4?t=1674650032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Cautious Exploration<br></li><li>Puzzle Solving<br></li><li>Inventory Management<br></li><li>Fight a Variety of Monsters<br></li><li>Bonus Challenge Modes<br></li><li>No Hand-Holding</li></ul><br>Still unsure if it's for you? Try out the demo!<br><br><strong>They are waiting for you...</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003470/extras/898c88d2bf8110c2e0185f4a61204666.avif?t=1674650032\" /></div>",
