les.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003470/extras/046109983b6f3700738fd02ef36e0eec.poster.avif?t=1674650032\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003470/extras/046109983b6f3700738fd02ef36e0eec.webm?t=1674650032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003470/extras/046109983b6f3700738fd02ef36e0eec.mp4?t=1674650032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Cautious Exploration<br></li><li>Puzzle Solving<br></li><li>Inventory Management<br></li><li>Fight a Variety of Monsters<br></li><li>Bonus Challenge Modes<br></li><li>No Hand-Holding</li></ul><br>Still unsure if it's for you? Try out the demo!<br><br><strong>They are waiting for you...</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003470/extras/898c88d2bf8110c2e0185f4a61204666.avif?t=1674650032\" /></div>",
